  "description": "The COMMENCAL SUPREME DH V5.2 ROCKSHOX delivers a race-ready component mix for fast, impact-heavy downhill riding.\n• ROCKSHOX Boxxer Ultimate and Vivid Coil Ultimate DH give strong support while keeping traction through hard compressions.\n• SRAM Maven Bronze 4-piston brakes with 220 mm rotors manage speed with progressive braking force.\n• DT SWISS F1900 Classic wheels and 370 Classic LN hubs provide a durable platform for repeated hard hits.\n• SRAM GX DH 7-speed with E13 Helix Core GR cranks and LG1+ guide keeps the drivetrain race-focused.\nA direct DH build for riders chasing speed with components designed for repeated punishment.",
